Skycat Tcl/Tk Source Distribution
---------------------------------

This directory contains the sources for the Tcl/Tk packages required
to build skycat.  For convenience, a Makefile is provided that will
configure, build and install all of the packages.

Installation
------------

Type:

    make prefix=/usr/local

replacing /usr/local with the top level directory where you would like
Tcl/Tk to be installed.

Note that some of the packages have been patched, so that they build
on all of the tested systems, however skycat does not depend on any
particular changes. In particular, BLT did not originally build 
correctly on MacOSX (The version included here is a slightly modified
BLT2.4z).


